IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `srcr-rules`
IMPORT `srcr-seat`

-- Safety, Rehabilitation and Compensation Regulations 2019 (Cth) -- cases for the claimant's questions (srcr-seat.l4).
-- Every expected value is worked by hand from the deposited text (Compilation No. 2 of the Regulations; Compilation
-- No. 82 of the Act for ss 4, 7(8), 8(9B)-(9G), 61(1A), 62(6)), with the section, and never copied from the encoding's
-- output. BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `Cases -- the claimant`

GIVEN d IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`on` d m y MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY d m y

GIVEN d1 IS A NUMBER, m1 IS A NUMBER, y1 IS A NUMBER, d2 IS A NUMBER, m2 IS A NUMBER, y2 IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Paused period`
`a pause from` d1 m1 y1 `to` d2 m2 y2 MEANS
    `Paused period` WITH
        `first day` IS DATE_FROM_DMY d1 m1 y1
        `last day` IS DATE_FROM_DMY d2 m2 y2

`no pauses` MEANS EMPTY

§§ `s 6, Schedule 2 -- Entities`

#ASSERT `Who is the principal officer of my employer under the Regulations?` `the Australian Federal Police` EQUALS JUST "the Commissioner of Police"
#ASSERT `Who is the principal officer of my employer under the Regulations?` `the Australian Signals Directorate` EQUALS JUST "the Director-General of the Australian Signals Directorate"
#ASSERT `Who is the principal officer of my employer under the Regulations?` `the Australian Secret Intelligence Service` EQUALS JUST "the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence Service"
#ASSERT `Who is the principal officer of my employer under the Regulations?` `the Australian Security Intelligence Organisation` EQUALS JUST "the Director-General of Security"
#ASSERT `Who is the principal officer of my employer under the Regulations?` `the Commonwealth Grants Commission` EQUALS JUST "the Chairperson"
#ASSERT `Who is the principal officer of my employer under the Regulations?` `the High Court of Australia` EQUALS JUST "the Chief Executive and Principal Registrar"
#ASSERT `Who is the principal officer of my employer under the Regulations?` `the Office of Official Secretary to the Governor-General` EQUALS JUST "the Official Secretary"
#ASSERT `Who is the principal officer of my employer under the Regulations?` `another employer` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Is my employer a prescribed Entity?` `the High Court of Australia` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my employer a prescribed Entity?` `another employer` EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 7 -- forms of medical treatment`

-- Each listed profession, therapeutic, a national authority exists and the practitioner is registered: prescribed.
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `an occupational therapist` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `an optometrist` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `a podiatrist` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `a psychologist` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `a speech therapist or speech pathologist` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 7(2)(a): where there is an authority, membership of an association does not stand in for registration.
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `a psychologist` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 7(2)(b): no authority, a member of a relevant professional association: prescribed; not a member: not.
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `a speech therapist or speech pathologist` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `a speech therapist or speech pathologist` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `a speech therapist or speech pathologist` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Outside s 7's reach: another practitioner; not therapeutic treatment.
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `another kind of practitioner` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Is my treatment prescribed medical treatment?` `a psychologist` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

